rt of Construction for 320 New Units</h3>\\r\\n              <p class=\\\"rel-card-excerpt\\\">Deputy Governor Wycliffe Wakholi presided over the ground-breaking ceremony at the Endebess AHP site, signalling the formal commencement of Phase 2 construction works.</p>\\r\\n              <a href=\\\"news-article.php\\\" class=\\\"rel-card-link\\\">Read Article <i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i></a>\\r\\n            </div>\\r\\n          </article>\\r\\n\\r\\n          <!-- Related Card 2 -->\\r\\n          <article class=\\\"rel-card\\\">\\r\\n            <div class=\\\"rel-card-img\\\" style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0d0918,#150d2c)\\\">\\r\\n              <div class=\\\"rel-card-img-ph\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-file-contract\\\"></i></div>\\r\\n              <img src=\\\"uploads/news/policy-affordable-housing.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"CS Hinga at AHP policy briefing\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" onerror=\\\"this.style.display=\'none\'\\\">\\r\\n              <span class=\\\"news-cat-badge news-cat--policy\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;\\\">Policy</span>\\r\\n            </div>\\r\\n            <div class=\\\"rel-card-body\\\">\\r\\n              <div class=\\\"rel-card-meta\\\">\\r\\n                <time class=\\\"rel-card-date\\\" datetime=\\\"2026-05-08\\\">\\r\\n                  <i class=\\\"fa-regular fa-calendar\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i> 8 May 2026\\r\\n                </time>\\r\\n                <span class=\\\"rel-card-date\\\"><i class=\\\"fa-regular fa-clock\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i> 5 min</span>\\r\\n              </div>\\r\\n              <h3 class=\\\"rel-card-title\\\">CS Hinga Announces KSh 450M Additional Allocation for Trans-Nzoia AHP</h3>\\r\\n              <p class=\\\"rel-card-excerpt\\\">Speaking at the National Housing Summit in Nairobi, CS Hinga confirmed a supplementary budget allocation of KSh 450 million for Trans-Nzoia County.</p>\\r\\n              <a href=\\\"news-article.php\\\" class=\\\"rel-card-link\\\">Read Article <i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i></a>\\r\\n            </div>\\r\\n          </article>\\r\\n\\r\\n          <!-- Related Card 3 -->\\r\\n          <article class=\\\"rel-card\\\">\\r\\n            <div class=\\\"rel-card-img\\\" style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#001812,#002b20)\\\">\\r\\n              <div class=\\\"rel-card-img-ph\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-people-group\\\"></i></div>\\r\\n              <img src=\\\"uploads/news/community-engagement.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Community beneficiary registration session\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" onerror=\\\"this.style.display=\'none\'\\\">\\r\\n              <span class=\\\"news-cat-badge news-cat--community\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;\\\">Community</span>\\r\\n            </div>\\r\\n            <div class=\\\"rel-card-body\\\">\\r\\n              <div class=\\\"rel-card-meta\\\">\\r\\n                <time class=\\\"rel-card-date\\\" datetime=\\\"2026-04-28\\\">\\r\\n                  <i class=\\\"fa-regular fa-calendar\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i> 28 Apr 2026\\r\\n                </time>\\r\\n                <span class=\\\"rel-card-date\\\"><i class=\\\"fa-regular fa-clock\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i> 3 min</span>\\r\\n              </div>\\r\\n              <h3 class=\\\"rel-card-title\\\">Saboti Constituency Beneficiary Registration Opens ???????? Over 1,200 Apply in First Week</h3>\\r\\n              <p class=\\\"rel-card-excerpt\\\">The beneficiary registration exercise for Saboti Constituency&rsquo;s 180-unit AHP allocation drew overwhelming interest, with more than 1,200 applications submitted in the opening week.</p>\\r\\n              <a href=\\\"news-article.php\\\" class=\\\"rel-card-link\\\">Read Article <i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i></a>\\r\\n            </div>\\r\\n          </article>\\r\\n\\r\\n        </div><!-- /article-related-grid -->\\r\\n      </div><!-- /container -->\\r\\n    </section>\\r\\n\\r\\n    <!-- ===== VERTICAL SHARE BAR ===== -->\\r\\n    <aside class=\\\"article-share-vertical\\\" aria-label=\\\"Share this article\\\">\\r\\n      <span class=\\\"article-share-vertical-label\\\">Share</span>\\r\\n      <button class=\\\"article-share-vertical-btn\\\" data-action=\\\"share-x\\\" data-label=\\\"X / Twitter\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" aria-label=\\\"Share on X / Twitter\\\">\\r\\n        <svg width=\\\"14\\\" height=\\\"14\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z\\\"/></svg>\\r\\n      </button>\\r\\n      <button class=\\\"article-share-vertical-btn\\\" data-action=\\\"share-fb\\\" data-label=\\\"Facebook\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" aria-label=\\\"Share on Facebook\\\">\\r\\n        <svg width=\\\"14\\\" height=\\\"14\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z\\\"/></svg>\\r\\n      </button>\\r\\n      <button class=\\\"article-share-vertical-btn\\\" data-action=\\\"share-wa\\\" data-label=\\\"WhatsApp\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" aria-label=\\\"Share on WhatsApp\\\">\\r\\n        <i class=\\\"fa-brands fa-whatsapp\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i>\\r\\n      </button>\\r\\n      <button class=\\\"article-share-vertical-btn\\\" data-action=\\\"copy-link\\\" data-label=\\\"Copy Link\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" aria-label=\\\"Copy article link\\\">\\r\\n        <i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-link\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></i>\\r\\n      </button>\\r\\n    </aside>\\r\\n\\r\\n  </main><!-- /main -->\\r\\n\\r\\n  <!-- ==================== FOOTER ==================== -->\\n<?php include __DIR__ . \\\"/app/partials/\\\" . \'footer.php\'; ?>\\n<?php include __DIR__ . \\